$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tm2fdrop  LOC_AFTER=?

* The fragment ` dropNum ` of TM/Prims.lean: the label pops the whole scanned word and its terminator and jumps to the exit, in ` ( # ` W ) + 1 ` steps --- Lean's ` dropNum_runs ` bound ` l.length + 1 ` .  Two one-step lemmas, ~ tm2hwrd and ~ tm2hseq .

